WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.270
A poster.

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:05.460
A dark-blue photo, and three
short lines of white text.

3
00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:06.960
Count the words.

4
00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:11.320
One, two, three, all the way to 15.

5
00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.700
Now pull back.

6
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.120
Look at all that empty space around them.

7
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:16.630
Fifteen words.

8
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.010
One photo.

9
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.890
So where is all the meaning?

10
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.030
In this mission, you'll ask
what kind of text this is,

11
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.880
and who it is meant for.

12
00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.610
You'll learn the conventions
of five text types,

13
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.200
from an advert's call to
action to a speech's tricolon.

14
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.610
And you'll ask whether the
photo is just decoration.

15
00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.800
Your mission: find out
where the meaning is.
